05802","name":{"zh":"玄铁枪","en":"Dark Iron Spear"},"level":"1","description":{"zh":"用较为稀有的玄铁锻制而成，可刺穿厚重的铠甲。","en":"Forged from rare dark iron, capable of piercing heavy armor."},"atkVal":"5","price":"2000","slot":{"zh":"武器","en":"Weapon"}},{"id":"WP1004805","name":{"zh":"单片护心甲","en":"Single-Plate Heart Guard"},"level":"1","description":{"zh":"在单片甲的基础上额外添加了一件铁护心，通常由校尉或伍长穿戴。","en":"Single-plate armor with an added iron heart guard, typically worn by captains or squad leaders."},"defenceVal":"9","price":"3800","slot":{"zh":"护甲","en":"Armor"}},{"id":"WP1019705","name":{"zh":"铁盔·乙","en":"Iron Helm - II"},"level":"1","description":{"zh":"战场上最常见的铁盔，从大将到伍长都有可能佩戴，偶尔会加些个人风格的装饰。","en":"The most common iron helm on the battlefield, worn by anyone from generals to squad leaders, sometimes with personal decorations added."},"defenceVal":"4","price":"2200","slot":{"zh":"头盔","en":"Helmet"}}],"family":{"father":{"label":{"zh":"父亲","en":"Father"},"people":[{"id":"WJ10014","code":"0"}]},"family":{"label":{"zh":"亲属","en":"Relatives"},"people":[{"id":"WJ10459","code":"100"}]}},"clans":[{"id":"GI111715","name":{"zh":"常山赵氏","en":"The Zhao clan of Changshan"},"years":["0","999"],"desc":{"zh":"出自嬴姓，战国赵国王族支庶余脉。秦汉时期，南越王赵佗即出自此脉，其家小留在真定，成为当地望族。蜀汉重要将门。赵云为“五虎上将”之一，以忠勇闻名。其子赵统袭爵，赵广随姜维战死。家族世代为将，是蜀汉政权中后期的重要军事力量。","en":"Descended from the Ying surname, a cadet branch of the royal house of Zhao during the Warring States period. In the Qin and Han eras, King Zhao Tuo of South Yue hailed from this lineage, his Family remained in Zhending, becoming a prominent local lineage. An essential military house of Shu Han, Zhao Yun was one of the ‘Five Tiger Generals,’ renowned for his loyalty and valor. His son Zhao Tong inherited his title, while Zhao Guang fell in battle alongside Jiang Wei. The Family produced generals across generations, standing as a vital military pillar in the mid-to-late period of Shu Han."},"talent":{"military":"7","commerce":"3","politics":"4"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":null,"honorifics"