P1019705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10129","city":"CS1032","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[70,75,52,55,65,81],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"650","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005802","armor":"WP1004805","helmet":"WP1019705"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[{"kind":"plot","id":"1012419","name":{"zh":"常山云暮","en":"Twilight of Changshan's Cloud"},"year":"228","month":"4","desc":{"zh":"返回赵府面见赵云，引二子谨奉其父教诲，静待前路启悟......\n\n亲历条件：【身属刘禅势力】、【成都属刘禅】、【玩家武力至少为85】、【与赵云的关系至少为3级且不为亲属和夫妻】、【与赵统、赵广的关系至少为1级】\n\n禁忌条件：主角不为赵云、赵统、赵广\n\n逆天改命：【<答应赵云>可收赵统、赵广为家将】【<赵统、赵广完成考验>可获得赵云武魂】","en":"Return to the Zhao Residence to meet Zhao Yun, guiding his two sons to heed their father's teachings and await enlightenment on the road ahead...\n\n\n\nParticipation Conditions: 【Belong to Liu Shan's Faction】, 【Chengdu belongs to Liu Shan】, 【Player STR is at least 85】, 【Relationship with Zhao Yun is at least Level 3, and not Kin or Spouse】, 【Relationship with Zhao Tong and Zhao Guang is at least Level 1】\n\n\n\nExclusion Conditions: Protagonist cannot be Zhao Yun, Zhao Tong, or Zhao Guang\n\n\n\nDefy Fate: 【<Agree to Zhao Yun's request> Recruit Zhao Tong and Zhao Guang as Retainers】【<Zhao Tong and Zhao Guang complete the trial> Obtain Zhao Yun's Martial Spirit】"}}],"biography":{"zh":"蜀国武将，赵云次子。忠烈果敢，继承父志。诸葛亮再次北伐前夕，与赵统前来告知诸葛亮赵云病逝一事。后被刘禅封为牙门将。在姜维沓中屯田时，随军抵御邓艾。为掩护主力撤退，于沓中临阵战死。","tc":"蜀國武將，趙云次子。忠烈果敢，繼承父志。諸葛亮再次北伐前夕，與趙統前來告知諸葛亮趙云病逝一事。后被劉禪封為牙門將。在姜維沓中屯田時，隨軍抵御鄧艾。為掩護主力撤退，于沓中臨陣戰死。","en":"An officer of Shu and the second son of Zhao Yun. Loyal and courageous, he inherited his father's aspirations. On the eve of Zhuge Liang's next Northern Expedition, he and Zhao Tong came to inform Zhuge Liang of Zhao Yun's passing. Liu Shan later appointed him as Tooth-Gate General. When Jiang Wei was garrisoned at Tazhong, Zhao Guang served in the army defending against Deng Ai. To cover the retreat of the main force, he fought at the front and was killed in action at Tazhong.","jp":"蜀の武将。趙雲の次男。忠烈果敢で父の志を継ぐ。諸葛亮が再び北伐を行う直前、趙統と共に趙雲の病没を諸葛亮に報告した。後に劉禅から牙門将に任じられる。姜維が沓中で屯田した際、軍に従って鄧艾を迎え撃った。主力の撤退を援護するため、沓中にて陣頭で戦死した。","kr":"촉나라의 무장이자 조운의 차남. 충렬하고 과감하여 부친의 뜻을 계승했다. 제갈량이 다시 북벌에 나서기 직전, 조통과 함께 찾아와 조운의 병사 소식을 전했다. 이후 유선에 의해 아문장에 임명되었다. 강유가 답중에서 둔전할 당시 군을 따라 등애를 저지했으며, 주력의 퇴각을 엄호하고자 답중의 진전에서 전사했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10462","remark":"","surname":"赵","surnameTc":"趙","surnameEn":"Zhao","surnameJp":"趙","surnameKr":"조","surnameOther":"","name":"广","nameTc":"廣","nameEn":"Guang","nameJp":"広","nameKr":"광","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"赵广","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"224","city":"CS1039","gender":"0","rule":"70","force":"75","wise":"52","politics":"55","charm":"65","will":"81","ruleTalent":"7","forceTalent":"8","wiseTalent":"4","politicsTalent":"5","charmTalent":"7","willTalent":"11","weaponMaster":"69/21/21/21/21/13/50/21","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"S1000105","battleSoul":"1012205","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"4600","battleSoulPoint":"5300","debateSoulPoint":"2700","strategy":"1007115","strategy2":"1001305","professions":"1/0/3/1/1/0/1/0/0/0/0/0/1/0/2/1/0/0/0/1/0/1/2/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"7","compatible":"50","loyalty":"0","reputation":"650","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"210","show":"224","death":"263","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"1","weapon":"WP1005802","armor":"WP1004805","helmet":"WP1019705","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"